      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'BREATHE. BALANCE. BE A TRUCK.


    Follow seven poses. PITCH/ROLL uses
    forward/back for pitch and left/right for lean. Tap ACTION to change banks. LIFT/TWIST
    uses forward/back to raise/lower and left/right to twist.


    For these truck
    bodies, CAB TWIST turns the complete truck and its wheels together. Your saved
    customization stays selected.


    Settle accurately and hold 3 seconds. Accuracy,
    stability and actual hold duration earn points; movement lowers stability. Each
    challenge pose has a 22-second attempt window. Highest total wins. AI uses the
    same controls.


    FREE YOGA has no score, winner or time limit. Use NEXT POSE
    to explore and FINISH CLASS when ready, also available in Pause. Pause/help never
    advances a pose.'
